# This is a bit awkward, wouldn't you say?
# This `public/` folder is used to serve static assets by Vite.
# During demo-app development, you will be loading all the source files statically to see in-browser, so we need those.
# During publish, we do NOT want to send all those files out, so we must ignore them.
# Therefore the .npmignore is copied over to `dist-lib` and overrides the `.gitignore`.
.gitignore
static/